1
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:15,236
Quelles langues tu parles ?
Which languages do you speak?

2
00:00:15,336 --> 00:00:23,012
Je parle français, anglais et un peu espagnol. J'apprends l'italien depuis un an.
I speak French, English and a little Spanish. I've been learning Italian for a year.

3
00:00:23,112 --> 00:00:25,868
Tu le parles couramment ?
Do you speak it fluently?

4
00:00:25,968 --> 00:00:33,188
Pas encore, mais je le comprends bien. Mon accent est encore difficile.
Not yet, but I understand it well. My accent is still difficult.

5
00:00:33,288 --> 00:00:37,748
Pour progresser, il faut parler tous les jours.
To make progress, you have to speak every day.

6
00:00:37,848 --> 00:00:44,540
Je sais. Je regarde aussi des films sans sous-titres pour m'entraîner.
I know. I also watch films without subtitles to practise.
